# ABP MongoDB

## MongoDbContext
```csharp
[ConnectionStringName("Default")]
public class MyMongoDbContext : AbpMongoDbContext
{
    public IMongoCollection<Book> Books => Collection<Book>();

    protected override void CreateModel(IMongoModelBuilder modelBuilder)
    {
        base.CreateModel(modelBuilder);
        modelBuilder.ConfigureMyModule();
    }
}
```

## Model Configuration
```csharp
public static void ConfigureMyModule(this IMongoModelBuilder builder)
{
    builder.Entity<Book>(b =>
    {
        b.CollectionName = "Books";
    });
}
```

## Repository Implementation
```csharp
public class BookRepository : MongoDbRepository<MyMongoDbContext, Book, Guid>, IBookRepository
{
    public BookRepository(IMongoDbContextProvider<MyMongoDbContext> dbContextProvider)
        : base(dbContextProvider)
    {
    }

    public async Task<List<Book>> GetPublishedBooksAsync()
    {
        return await (await GetQueryableAsync())
            .Where(b => b.IsPublished)
            .ToListAsync();
    }
}
```

## Notes
- `includeDetails` parameter is often ignored (documents include sub-collections)
- Use `GetQueryableAsync()` for ABP data filters
- Entity change auditing not supported
